      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      9.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      56.49,
      465.3,
      296.16,
      536.94
    ],
    "text": "An Allotment of Land called Mahawatta in total extent of about0.1034 Hectare, described in the Advance Tracing No.: Ma/PLL/2013/360 and dated 24.04.2014, prepared by the Surveyor-Generalsituated in the Village of Moragaspitiya (F.V.P 33) in UdugodaUdasiya Pattuwa Minor Division in the Divisional Secretary'sDivision of Pallepola in Matale District, Central Province andbounded as follows:",
